yle=\"width:auto;height:30px\">4</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">5</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">6</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">−</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">1</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">2</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">3</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">+</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)\">\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(#7f8590,#5b626d);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)\">Settings</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e8e8ec;padding:12px\">\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #b8bcc4;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Wireless LAN</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2a7de1;text-shadow:0 1px 0 #fff\">Home-WiFi ></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Notification</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Location service</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-bar\">Newsstand</div>\n        <div style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#7a5230 0 8px,#6a4527 8px 16px);padding:18px 20px 0\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/slide-city.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"height:14px;margin-top:-2px;background:linear-gradient(#8a5f3a,#5e3d20);box-shadow:0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:2px\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat-notes\">\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-bar\" data-ap=\"leather\">备忘录</span>\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-paper style-skeuomorphism-anat-paper\" data-ap=\"paper\">横线黄纸 + 红边距线</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\" data-ap=\"gloss\">玻璃高光按钮</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch linen\" data-ap=\"texture\" style=\"width:76px\">亚麻布纹</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-shadowchip\" data-ap=\"shadow\">真实投影</span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat-notes\">\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-bar\" data-ap=\"leather\">Memo</span>\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-paper style-skeuomorphism-anat-paper\" data-ap=\"paper\">Horizontal yellow paper + red margin line</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\" data-ap=\"gloss\">Glass highlight button</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch linen\" data-ap=\"texture\" style=\"width:76px\">Linen pattern</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-shadowchip\" data-ap=\"shadow\">Real shadow</span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"leather","cn":"皮革缝线标题栏","en":"Stitched Leather","desc":"棕色渐变打底，上下两条虚线当缝线，文字用内阴影压出凹刻感","desc_en":"Brown gradient base, two dotted lines at the top and bottom serve as stitches, and the text is embossed with an inner shadow to create an indented feel."},{"key":"paper","cn":"黄纸纹理","en":"Yellow Legal Pad","desc":" repeating 渐变画横线，左侧一条红色边距线，配手写感字体","desc_en":"Repeating gradient draws horizontal lines, a red margin line on the left, and handwriting-like fonts"},{"key":"gloss","cn":"玻璃高光","en":"Glossy Highlight","desc":"可用浅色渐变和内高光提示光滑材质；只在需要时使用，避免影响文字","desc_en":"Use light gradients and inner highlights to indicate smooth materials; use them only when needed to avoid affecting text"},{"key":"texture","cn":"亚麻布纹底","en":"Linen Texture","desc":"两组交叉的细密 repeating 渐变，大面积空白处的经典打底","desc_en":"Two sets of intersecting fine repeating gradients, a classic base for large blank spaces"},{"key":"shadow","cn":"真实投影","en":"Realistic Shadow","desc":"大而柔、带环境色的投影，让元素像真的浮在桌面上","desc_en":"Large, soft, and ambient-colored projections make elements really appear to be floating on the desktop."}]},"use":[{"t":"面向初次使用设备的人，用现实线索帮助理解","m":"style-skeuomorphism-2007"},{"t":"复古、手账和乐器应用，材质本身是主题","m":"style-skeuomorphism-retro"},{"t":"相机和合成器等拟真控制面板","m":"style-skeuomorphism-panel"},{"t":"现代界面里的少量局部材质装饰","m":"style-skeuomorphism-deco"}],"dont":[{"t":"把正文直接放在干扰阅读的复杂纹理上","m":"style-skeuomorphism-noise-bad","bad":true},{"t":"过度依赖大图材质，造成加载和缩放问题","m":"style-skeuomorphism-heavy-bad","bad":true},{"t":"数据密集工具让装饰降低扫描效率","m":"style-skeuomorphism-bms-bad","bad":true},{"t":"整站复制旧系统外观，却没有明确复古目的","m":"style-skeuomorphism-all-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"选择用户熟悉的现实物体，让材质和形状帮助理解功能","m":"style-skeuomorphism-material"},{"t":"用高光和投影表达凸起、凹下和可以按动的状态","m":"style-skeuomorphism-gloss"},{"t":"先保证操作含义清楚，再增加皮革、金属或纸张等细节","m":"style-skeuomorphism-affordance"},{"t":"纹理只用于不影响阅读的区域，并控制图片体积","m":"style-skeuomorphism-texture"},{"t":"在现代产品中优先局部使用，避免材质覆盖所有内容","m":"style-skeuomorphism-heavy"}],"history":[{"year":"2007.01","title":"iPhone 发布，拟物界面受关注","desc":"滑动解锁、翻页日历等界面把现实动作和材质带入触屏产品，帮助用户理解交互方式。","title_en":"The iPhone brings skeuomorphism to touchscreens","desc_en":"Slide to unlock, page-turning calendars, and other physical references helped first-generation touchscreen users understand unfamiliar actions."},{"year":"2010—2012","title":"质感表现广泛出现","desc":"iOS 5/6 中的黄纸备忘录、木质报刊亭和绿毡 Game Center，呈现了不同的现实材质隐喻。","title_en":"The peak of rich digital material","desc_en":"iOS 5 and 6 used yellow paper, wooden shelves, green felt, leather, and other detailed scenes across built-in apps."},{"year":"2013.09","title":"iOS 7 扁平化转向","desc":"iOS 7 以更简化的界面取代此前大量皮革与亚麻纹理；这一变化加速了业内对扁平化的讨论。","title_en":"iOS 7 turns toward flat design","desc_en":"Apple removed most leather, linen, and realistic texture, and the wider industry quickly moved toward flatter interfaces."},{"year":"2020s","title":"装饰性材质再被探索","desc":"新拟态、玻璃和空间材质等方向再次引起讨论；拟物元素更多作为局部表现方式出现。","title_en":"Material returns as an accent","desc_en":"Neumorphism and spatial platforms brought back glass, depth, and physical material, usually as a supporting effect rather than the whole interface."}],"prompt":"做一个复古旅行日志应用，让相册、地图和收藏内容具有清楚的识别线索。用少量有意义的材料和触感提示帮助理解功能，按钮与文字仍要清楚；不要把纹理和高光铺满整个界面。","prompt_en":"Focused skeuomorphic interface with one useful physical analogy, internally consistent material and lighting, stitched leather or linen used sparingly, glossy controls with clear labels, realistic but restrained shadows","references":[{"title":"拟物化","source":"NN/g","url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/skeuomorphism/","title_en":"Skeuomorphism"}],"scenes":["拟物化磁带录音台","iOS 6 计算器","iOS 6 设置开关页","iOS 报刊亭书架"],"en":{"prompt":"Focused skeuomorphic interface with one useful physical analogy, internally consistent material and lighting, stitched leather or linen used sparingly, glossy controls with clear labels, realistic but restrained shadows","use":[{"t":"Music and instrument interfaces","m":"style-skeuomorphism-2007"},{"t":"Games and playful tools","m":"style-skeuomorphism-retro"},{"t":"A focused control with a useful physical analogy","m":"style-skeuomorphism-panel"},{"t":"Brand experiences built around craft or material","m":"style-skeuomorphism-deco"}],"dont":[{"t":"Cover an entire work tool in decorative textures","m":"style-skeuomorphism-noise-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Copy a physical limitation that makes the digital task slower","m":"style-skeuomorphism-heavy-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Use realistic shading without clear interaction states","m":"style-skeuomorphism-bms-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Assume a physical reference is familiar to every audience","m":"style-skeuomorphism-all-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Use the physical reference to clarify an interaction","m":"style-skeuomorphism-material"},{"t":"Keep light, material, and depth internally consistent","m":"style-skeuomorphism-gloss"},{"t":"Preserve readable labels and digital accessibility","m":"style-skeuomorphism-affordance"},{"t":"Apply detail to a small number of important objects","m":"style-skeuomorphism-texture"},{"t":"Let digital behavior stay efficient even when the appearance is familiar","m":"style-skeuomorphism-heavy"}],"scenes":["Music player","Instrument control","Game interface","Craft brand"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-head\"><span>MELLOWTAPE</span><b>SESSION / VOCAL 04</b><i>● RECORDING</i></div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-board\">\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-track\"><b>VOICE</b><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-wave\"></span><em>-8 dB</em></div>\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-track\"><b>GUITAR</b><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-wave alt\"></span><em>-14 dB</em></div>\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-fader\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-footer\"><span>00:02:18 / 03:40</span><b>● <i>RECORD</i></b><span>48 kHz · STEREO</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"width:264px;border-radius:20px;border:3px solid #26262a;background:#1c1c1e;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(#d7dce4,#b9c0cb);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.15);text-align:right;padding:8px 14px;font-size:26px;font-weight:300;color:#2b2f36;margin-bottom:12px\">1,024</div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px\">\n          <span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">C</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">±</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">%</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">÷</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">7</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">8</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">9</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">×</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">4</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">5</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">6</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">−</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">1</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">2</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">3</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">+</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)\">\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(#7f8590,#5b626d);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)\">Settings</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e8e8ec;padding:12px\">\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #b8bcc4;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Wireless LAN</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2a7de1;text-shadow:0 1px 0 #fff\">Home-WiFi ></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Notification</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">Location service</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-bar\">Newsstand</div>\n        <div style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#7a5230 0 8px,#6a4527 8px 16px);padding:18px 20px 0\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/slide-city.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"height:14px;margin-top:-2px;background:linear-gradient(#8a5f3a,#5e3d20);box-shadow:0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:2px\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"history":[{"title":"The iPhone brings skeuomorphism to touchscreens","desc":"Slide to unlock, page-turning calendars, and other physical references helped first-generation touchscreen users understand unfamiliar actions."},{"title":"The peak of rich digital material","desc":"iOS 5 and 6 used yellow paper, wooden shelves, green felt, leather, and other detailed scenes across built-in apps."},{"title":"iOS 7 turns toward flat design","desc":"Apple removed most leather, linen, and realistic texture, and the wider industry quickly moved toward flatter interfaces."},{"title":"Material returns as an accent","desc":"Neumorphism and spatial platforms brought back glass, depth, and physical material, usually as a supporting effect rather than the whole interface."}]},"usageMocks":{"style-skeuomorphism-2007":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">教长辈用平板</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\">点这里发语音</span></div>","style-skeuomorphism-retro":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch leather\" style=\"width:64px\">日记本</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">复古手账应用，材质支持主题表达</span></div></div>","style-skeuomorphism-panel":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch wood\">木</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch metal\">弦</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);max-width:120px\">相机、录音、合成器的拟真面板</span></div>","style-skeuomorphism-deco":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-strip\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">现代浅色界面里，局部一条皮革当点缀</span></div>","style-skeuomorphism-noise-bad":"<span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch linen\" style=\"width:150px;height:44px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7a6a4a\">正文落在纹理上</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">纹理会干扰正文阅读</span>","style-skeuomorphism-heavy-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">一个界面使用多张材质图</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">资源需评估</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">过多位图会增加加载与适配成本</span>","style-skeuomorphism-bms-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch leather\" style=\"width:78px\">报表中心</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">材质与任务不匹配</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">效率工具应优先保证数据与操作清楚</span></div>","style-skeuomorphism-all-bad":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\">登录</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch metal\" style=\"width:40px\"></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch wood\" style=\"width:40px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">整站使用前，先验证材质是否支持内容与任务</span>"}}}